WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.350
Identify introductions, bodies and conclusions. Prefixes and suffixes can support

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.411
decoding and changing meanings.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:12.123
Which word contains a prefix meaning wrongly? Answer: misread

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:17.707
Mark the three parts of an informational text and explain two words with affixes.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:20.581
Why it works: Mis- can mean wrongly.
